  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building peace and security through support to women&#x2010;led CSOs in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to strengthen the capacity of women-led CSOs, enabling them to work with women and youth along with local authorities to jointly address community security concerns, including those associated with participation in and/or support for violent groups.</narrative>
  </description>
